{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-vwqr-4mjv-ffrm","cve_id":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/frappe/security-advisories/GHSA-vwqr-4mjv-ffrm","html_url":"https://github.com/frappe/frappe/security/advisories/GHSA-vwqr-4mjv-ffrm","summary":"Unauthorised sending of email in email communication due to missing validation","description":"### Summary\r\n\r\nCertain endpoints related to email communication did not enforce proper authorization checks.\r\n\r\n### Details\r\n\r\nAn existing authorization check could be satisfied by users who were not meant to send email from the site. Validation was added to restrict this to permitted users.\r\n\r\nNo workaround available; upgrading is required.\r\n\r\n### Proof of concept\r\n\r\nAn authenticated user with minimal privileges sends a crafted request to an affected endpoint.\r\n\r\n### Impact\r\n\r\nAny authenticated user, including a Website User, could send email through the site's configured email account and make it appear to come from another sender. This could be used for spam or phishing in the organisation's name, and could expose some files the user is not permitted to access. This flaw has been exploited in the wild.","severity":"high","author":null,"publisher":{"login":"diptanilsaha","id":50792171,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzkyMTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50792171?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/diptanilsaha","html_url":"https://github.com/diptanilsaha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diptanilsaha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diptanilsaha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diptanilsaha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diptanilsaha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diptanilsaha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diptanilsaha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diptanilsaha/repos","events_ur